  "description": "The Bighorn is a modern hardtail with contemporary geometry and spec that is up to the challenge of just about any trail. The 27.5+ tires on the Bighorn provide gobs of traction and stability for increased confidence on the trail and act as micro suspension so you don't get beat up hammering over roots and rocks. A2-SL alloy frame with smooth welds builds a frame that is strong and lightweight with a refined look. Internal cable routing keeps all cables shielded from mud and debris for crisp shifting every time. Boost 148x12 rear and 110x15 front hub spacing stiffens the Bighorn's chassis, creates stronger wheels, allows for shorter chainstays and larger chainring options. 27.5\" x 3.0\" tires stock with clearance to run up to 3.25\" tires. Dropper seatpost on all models.",
